{"shortDescription":"Stock index futures rose early Wednesday as investors drew encouragement from Nvidia's NASDAQ:NVDA stronger-than-expected quarterly results and upbeat revenue outlook, even as Wall Street's benchmark indexes extended their losing streak on Tuesday's trading.Nasdaq 100 futures NASDAQ:NDX jumped +0.8…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Stock index futures rose early Wednesday as investors drew encouragement from Nvidia's ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:NVDA","text":"NASDAQ:NVDA"}}," stronger-than-expected quarterly results and upbeat revenue outlook, even as Wall Street's benchmark indexes extended their losing streak on Tuesday's trading."]},{"type":"p","children":["Nasdaq 100 futures ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:NDX","text":"NASDAQ:NDX"}}," jumped +0.84%. S\u0026P 500 futures ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TVC:SPX","text":"TVC:SPX"}}," gained +0.51% and Dow futures ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TVC:DJI","text":"TVC:DJI"}}," edged higher by +0.25%."]},{"type":"p","children":["Nvidia shares climbed 3.2% in extended trading after the chipmaker beat third-quarter earnings and revenue estimates and projected 75% year-over-year revenue growth for the fiscal year ending January 2028."]},{"type":"p","children":["The results lifted sentiment across the broader AI infrastructure trade, with cloud computing companies CoreWeave ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:CRWV","text":"NASDAQ:CRWV"}}," and Nebius Group (NBIS), gaining 8% and 10%, respectively, after the bell."]},{"type":"p","children":["Beyond Nvidia, market participants will assess a fresh round of economic data, including building permits and housing starts, along with minutes from the Federal Reserve's October policy meeting."]},{"type":"p","children":["Earnings from Lowe's ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:LOW","text":"NYSE:LOW"}},", Target ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:TGT","text":"NYSE:TGT"}}," and TJX Companies ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:TJX","text":"NYSE:TJX"}}," will also be in focus Wednesday, while expectations surrounding Anthropic's upcoming IPO add another major AI-related event to the week's market calendar."]},{"type":"p","children":["U.S. Treasury yields edged lower across the curve. The 10-year Treasury yield ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TVC:US10Y","text":"TVC:US10Y"}}," fell 2.5 basis points to 5.10% and the 2-year Treasury yield ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TVC:US02Y","text":"TVC:US02Y"}}," slipped 1.1 basis points to 4.80%. The 30-year Treasury yield ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TVC:US30Y","text":"TVC:US30Y"}}," declined 2.0 basis points to 5.44%."]},{"type":"p","children":["Top gainers included Flex ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:FLEX","text":"NASDAQ:FLEX"}}," +5.69%, Hewlett Packard Enterprise ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:HPE","text":"NYSE:HPE"}}," +5.49%, and Coherent ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:COHR","text":"NYSE:COHR"}}," +5.29%. Decliners included Freeport-McMoRan ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:FCX","text":"NYSE:FCX"}}," -2.41%, Insulet ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:PODD","text":"NASDAQ:PODD"}}," -2.32%, and Keurig Dr Pepper ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:KDP","text":"NASDAQ:KDP"}}," -1.98%.",{"type":"disclaimer","children":["Content provided by Seeking Alpha is intended for information purposes only, and that Seeking Alpha does not offer any personalist investment advice and is not a licensed securities dealer, broker, US investment adviser or investment bank."]}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Earnings","args":[{"id":"section","value":"earnings"}]},{"title":"Indices","args":[{"id":"category","value":"index"}]},{"title":"Seeking Alpha","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"seekingalpha"}]},{"title":"US stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value"